// Hook: 001701FC (was: lh v0,0x18(s4)) -> cave 1 in alignment padding at 0031B650 (48 bytes).
// 00170200 (lh v1,0x1a(s4)) is the hook's delay slot. Cave 1 ends with a jump to cave 2 (0032695C,
// alignment padding after a function return) which finishes the speed, re-executes lh v0,0x18(s4)
// and returns to 00170204.
