// ===== Caim: air attacks restart the super sprint count (needs the super sprint section) =====
// The jump start zeroes the count word 005B1F00 (cave 005B3000) but the air attacks started later in the jump (type 6 = R1 attack at 00175458, types 4/5 at 001752FC in FUN_00174FC0) did not, so a super sprint picked up again at full speed after the landing. Both now zero the count: cave 005B6D80 (type 6: delay-slot sw v0,0x660 already done, then lui v1,0x5B ; sw zero,0x1F00(v1) ; j 00175470) and 005B6D90 (types 4/5: the replaced sw v0,0x660(s1), the same zeroing, j 00175300).
patch=1,EE,005B6D80,word,3C03005B
patch=1,EE,005B6D84,word,AC601F00
patch=1,EE,005B6D88,word,0805D51C
