// ===== Ground: double jump attack = sprint jump attack (experimental) =====
// The jump state FUN_00174FC0 only sets the jump type [Caim+0x660] (1/2 normal, 3 = sprint jump when [0x6A0] >= 0x4000) at a grounded takeoff (170AD8 != 0), so after the double jump the type stays 0. The beq at 001751B4 becomes j DJS (DJS, old cave T space): when the takeoff is not allowed but the double-jump flag 0013E530 is 0x800 it calls FUN_001767A8(actor, 2) like the sprint takeoff, sets the jump type to 3 (sprint jump), and starts the automatic attack counter (0033F6D8 = 40) used by the automatic attack section. Needs the Double jump section.
