// ===== Ground: jump heavy attack start and landing 2x (needs the double jump attack section) =====
// The attack request code (00176364..) copies an entry of the animation parameter table (003BADB0, 16-byte entries: [0] animation id, [2] playback rate, 0x1000 = 1.0) into Caim +0x170.. when the attack starts. The sprint jump attack is entry 63 (003BB1A0: id 0xAB, rate 0x1200). Cave ARATE (0033EDD0, entered from the first T2 placeholder Lph, first nop turned into j ARATE) doubles only the rate of entry 65 (landing 0xAD); entries 63 (takeoff 0xAB) and 64 (0xAC, the mid-swing animation) stay at their vanilla 0x1200 / 0x1000 (the section name still says start and landing; it was not renamed so that PCSX2 keeps it ticked) while the double-jump flag 0013E530 is 0x800 and writes the vanilla values back otherwise, so only the jump heavy attack action is faster, not a vanilla sprint jump attack. 2026-11-10: the whole heavy attack runs at 8x now (cave moved to 005BDEC8) (entries 63 and 64 as well): ARATE shifts all three rates left by three while the flag is 0x800 (sllv).
