patch=1,EE,005B101C,word,0816DB50
// ===== Ground: R2 jump slash available right after takeoff =====
// The jump state (FUN_00174FC0) starts the jump attack in its second switch (case 0 of the jump type [Caim+0x660], after FUN_00170AD8: sub-state [+0x2DC] = 5, lock float [+0x740] <= 0, attack held bit 8 of [+0x66C]) only while fVar14 = Caim y - [Caim+0x650] (the ground reference, 0 here) is <= the float at gp-0x777C (0x00566774) = -13.0, i.e. Caim has to have risen 13 units after the takeoff first (a few frames; state 2 had y = -13.65). That is the lockout after the jump: an R2 press right at the start is not accepted. The float is only read at 001751BC (lwc1 f0,-0x777C(gp)); it is made +100000.0 (0x47C35000) so the condition holds from the first frame. The neighbouring float gp-0x7780 (-21.0) only sets the flag [Caim+0x65C] and is left alone.
patch=1,EE,00566774,word,47C35000
// ===== Caim: no flicker while invulnerable after a hit =====
// FUN_001792B0 toggles [Caim+0x92C] each frame while flag 0x40000 (invincibility status, set after being hit) is set and skips drawing on the off frames. Making the flag test read 0 keeps him drawn every frame.
patch=1,EE,001792D0,word,00121024
// ===== Ground: combo attacks turn Caim instantly toward the held stick direction (needs Lock-on: ground attacks face the locked enemy) =====
// 2026-10-28: fixed-camera (isometric) stages (Caim +0x6B4 = 4): the stick there is already in the camera frame (the actor frame stays on the camera yaw), so turning Caim by atan2 of it every frame made him spin. 005B7D14 now jumps to ISOCF (005BAE00), which skips the whole CF turn in that mode (exit 005B7EBC) and otherwise continues at 005B7D1C.
// Wrapper W (00342040, Controls remap section) runs the ground attack state FUN_0017C14C every frame and, while the R3 lock-on is on, turns Caim to the target with FACE. Its shared exit at 00342098 (lw v0,0x38(sp)) becomes j CF (005B7D00; the lw ra,0x30(sp) in its delay slot still runs). CF: when the lock-on is off (bit 0 of 00321E2C), Caim is in the ground attack state (+0x2D0 = 2, +0x2DC = 4) and the stick (shorts +0x67C x / +0x67E y in Caim's frame, forward = -y) is outside the dead zone (|x| + |y| >= 0x400), it computes delta = atan2(x, -y) (polynomial atan as in TURNC / FACE) and turns Caim the way FACE does: yaw-delta accumulator +0x204 = delta, +0x210 |= 2, chase yaw +0x584 = yaw +0x44 + delta (wrapped), +0x570 |= 1 (rebuild). Every frame of every combo strike, so he faces the stick at once and follows it. Then it finishes W's return (v0 from 0x38(sp), sp + 0x40, jr ra). With the lock-on the target facing stays as before.
patch=1,EE,005B7D00,word,3C080032
