// ===== Auto-attack: holding the attack action repeats the ground combo (Caim and the allies; needs the Square / Circle dodge section) =====
// 2026-10-30: AUTO also buffers a sprint: while Caim is in a ground combo (state 2 / sub 4) and L3 is held (pad byte 0056CD82 bit 1, active low) the word 005BE1F8 is set to 0xFF; a combo without L3 clears it. The sprint resume section (AUTOC2) uses it.
// 2026-10-30: AUTO also sets the word 005BE1FC while the attack action is held in the air (cleared when released). The hook at 00173CD8 (the attack start's walk-timer test: timer >= 0x4000 = sprint attack; cave 005BE3A0, it also keeps the R2-after-block flag 005B1F60 of the other section that hooks this word) then makes the first ground attack after such a landing a normal combo attack and clears the word.
// 2026-10-30: AUTO also sets NOSJ (005BE1F0) while the attack action is held in a ground combo (sub state 4); it is cleared when the action is released. The jump takeoff test of FUN_00174FC0 (walk timer >= 0x4000 = sprint jump slash) at 001751DC / 001751E0 (cave 005BE4A0) then gives a normal jump slash while NOSJ is set and ends the sprint (latch 002F345C off, multiplier 002F340C = 1.0, super sprint count 005B1F00 = 0).
// Hold the attack action to auto-attack on the ground, for Caim and the allies (Leonard 0x6A, Seere 0x6B, Arioch 0x6C in word 003ACF00). The attack action is found through the game's own mapping table (byte 005747B6 = button index, 0x0F = R2 by default; pressure byte = 00342864 + index). A counter (005BBFEC) counts the frames the button has been held; frames 1-7 of a hold always pass (a tap is never eaten), then on the ground it is cut for 8 frames and passed for 8. While airborne (Caim +0x2DC == 5, the jump state = the air slashes): the 2nd slash starts at hold frame 12 (AIR_SECOND) and from there the cycle is 10 frames (5 passed, 5 cut; 2026-10-30, was 20 with 3 slashes), so the 3rd slash comes at frame 22 and the 4th at frame 32 - the 4th keeps the time the 3rd had. Aerial stages are untouched. Hook 00321A74 goes to AUTO (005BD700), which continues into the Square / Circle cave SQ (005BBE00).
patch=1,EE,005BD700,word,3C080032
