// ===== Ground: double jump air slash has a quarter of the jump force (needs the slash jump double jump section) =====
// 2026-10-30 (fix): the arc used 0.25 only for the flag value 0x800, so when the 3rd slash raised the flag to 0xC00 in mid-arc the height factor jumped from 7 to 28 and the delta of that frame (sin * f21 minus the previous part) lifted Caim - the 'triple jump'. It is now scaled for every non-zero flag value, so the 2nd and 3rd slash stay on the same small arc until a fresh takeoff clears the flag.
// The jump arc function FUN_001756B0 (jump types 1 / 2; called from the jump state at 0017503C / 00175050) loads its arc height f21 = -28.0 (gp-30532) at 001756EC; each frame's vertical movement is sin(angle) * f21 minus the last frame's part, so f21 sets the jump height. The word at 001756EC becomes j 005BDD00: the cave does the replaced lwc1 and, while the slash double jump flag 0033F6DC is exactly 0x800 (the 2nd air slash; 0xC00 is the 3rd, 0 the 1st), scales f21 by 0.25 (-7.0; 2026-10-30: first 0.5, then halved again) before returning to 001756F4. Not tested in-game.
patch=1,EE,005BDD00,word,C79588BC
