[Lock-on and aiming]
author=Shade
description=The R3 lock-on, target selection and facing.
// 6 original sections merged here (the comment lines headed by ===== name ===== are the original sections).
// ===== Lock-on: R3 toggles the enemy lock-on (needs Input core) =====
// LK (00321CA8..00321CF0, reached from the end of RS) reads R3 from the raw pad (byte 0056CD82 bit 2, active low) and toggles bit 0 of 00321E2C on each press (bit 1 = R3 was down last frame). Every lock-on feature reads that bit.
patch=1,EE,00321CA8,word,3C180032
patch=1,EE,00321CAC,word,3C090057
patch=1,EE,00321CB0,word,9128CD82
