// ===== Lock-on: ground attacks face the locked enemy (needs the R3 toggle and Lock-on core) =====
// The attack state function FUN_0017C14C is called at 00173CE8 and 00173D4C; both jals go to wrapper W (00342040..003420A8), which calls it and then, while locked (bit 0 of 00321E2C) and Caim is in the ground attack state (main 2 at +0x2D0, sub 4 at +0x2DC), calls FACE. Movement is not touched. The combo stick facing section hooks W's exit (00342098) and needs this section.
patch=1,EE,00173CE8,word,0C0D0810
patch=1,EE,00173D4C,word,0C0D0810
