// ===== Camera: world-fixed 360 orbit (right stick X rotates) =====
// 0013E314 (delay slot of the cave's jr ra) = swc1 f2,0x44(s1): also writes the new world yaw W into cam+0x44 in the SAME frame. Before, the camera yaw was only correct one frame late (cam44 had already integrated Caim's yaw change), which showed as a flick whenever Caim's facing jumped (dodge start/end).
// Keeps the camera's world yaw W fixed; right stick X changes W. Each frame the yaw pan offset [cam+0x184] is set so that final yaw = W (offset = W - last yaw + last offset, wrapped to +-pi). Pitch untouched.
// Cave 0013E2A4..0013E314, W stored at 0013E538. If rotation feels mirrored change 0013E2BC 46011080 -> 46011081.
