// ===== Camera: fixed farther distance (no automatic zoom) =====
// Cleanup 2026-10-25: cave CAMD was moved from 00342720 (inside the game sound task object CTaskSound at 00342708) to 005B8180; the hook 00197448 now jumps to 005B8180 and the DA / DB caves return to 005B81E8 / 005B8218.
// The camera arm (distance from Caim) is held at a fixed 68 units (vanilla swings between about 45 and 110 depending on speed, pitch and easing), so it is a little farther out and does not zoom in and out by itself. Independent of the other camera cheats.
// Camera update FUN_00196DB4, final stage at 00197444..: the position vector at cam+0x80 is sent through the collision calls 001A1930/001A2B3C (a ray from the look-at point cam+0xE0 to the position). 00197448 (addiu s1,s1,0xE0) is replaced by j CAMD (cave at 00342720, zero memory in every save state); its delay slot 0019744C (ld v0,0(s0)) runs, then CAMD (only for the main camera object 003ADAC0) rescales the arm (position - look-at) to 68.0 WITHOUT changing its direction, stores 68.0 in cam+0x14C (the game keeps the arm length there), executes the replaced addiu, redoes the ld v0 and jumps back to 00197450. An earlier version slid the camera along its view axis instead; that drifted the arm direction and flipped the camera behind Caim. Change DIST in the generator to tune.
patch=1,EE,00197448,word,0816E060
