// Caim on foot: the camera eye is 5 units higher (about half of Caim, same tilt), eased; CAME 005BE680 (src/build_caimcam.py), hook 001974C4, data word 005BEE08
// 2026-10-27: the pitch (005B5600), vertical pan (005B5700..005B5CC0) and EYEFIX (005B5E00) caves were MOVED up by 0x5E00 (now 005BB400..005BBDCC): 005B4500..005B6000 is the game's ring of camera records (108 x 0x40, written while riding), so code and records overwrote each other. Old addresses in the notes are +0x5E00 now.
// 2026-10-27 walls: EYEFIX runs after the game's camera collision (001A1930 / 001A2B3C) and kept the eye on a sphere of the full arm [cam+0x14C] = 68, which undid every collision shortening between 20 and 68 units (camera behind fences / walls). Its first word now jumps to PRE (005BB200): the sphere radius is the arm the collision left (|eye - aim|), capped at 68, so EYEFIX only fixes the height and never pushes the eye back out. Generator build_eyecoll.py.
