// ===== Aerial: L3 glide drops the target and the lower flight limit is raised (XL; needs Aerial core) =====
// 2026-10-30: the Cross (0x4000) neutral reticle lock is only applied while the glide latch (0041FC90, t0 here) is set: 00340D98 branches past the whole Cross block to 00340DD0 when t0 == 0 (the lw t5 sits in its delay slot, the Cross test moved to 00340DA0 / 00340DA4). Outside the glide Cross is left to the game. (Correction 2026-10-30: the word tested first, 0041FC90, is the TARGET pointer, not a glide flag; 00340D98 now branches on t6 = glide active (dragon +0x3D54 > 0).)
// XL (00340D34, run from AER in aerial stages): raises the lower flight limit (dragon 0041C0E4 kept at or above -820), drops the target when the glide starts, centres the left stick and removes L2 while gliding. Glide homing is a separate section.
