// Brake mode swaps the sticks (2026-11-10, src/build_stickswap.py): while the brake toggle (R3) is on for the ridden ground Angelus the pad bytes right stick 00342864 / 65 and left stick 00342866 / 67 are swapped at the start of every ground pad update, so her steering, aim and dodge direction follow the RIGHT stick and the strafe / tilt (build_strafe.py) follow the original LEFT stick. The hook 00321A74 (ground path of T2, was j 005B8400 TILTF) now goes to SWAP (005BC9A0), which jumps on to TILTF. R3 / L3 and the other buttons are unchanged; R3 or the L2 boost clears the toggle, which also ends the swap.
