// Movement during the R1 special 2026-11-10 (src/build_specmove.py, DOD in build_strafe.py): FUN_001C09C8 (the ground ride update), while the special timer (+0x3DB8) runs, zeroed the lean +0xB4 (001C0A04), forced the pitch to -0.25 (001C0A08), zeroed the movement vector +0xF0 (001C0A0C sqc2) and the three angle deltas +0x100 / 104 / 108 (001C0A14 sqc2): she stood still and could not turn. Now 001C0A04 and 001C0A0C are nops and 001C0A14 is sw zero,256(s0) (only the pitch delta, the pitch stays at -0.25), so she moves, turns and banks as usual during the spell. PRE (005BCD80, hook 001C09DC jal 001C3EBC) clears, while the special timer runs, the pad action bits of L2 (a1+8 bit 0x100) and a1+0xC (0x100, 0x01000000, 0x02000000 = the dodges) and the dodge buffers +0x3DC4 / +0x3DC8, so boost and dodges do nothing; DOD (the brake mode L3 dodge) checks the timer too. Regular attacks are already off while the special runs. Undo: 001C09DC = 0C070FAF, 001C0A04 = E60D00B4, 001C0A0C = F8600000, 001C0A14 = F8400000.
