// Fast mode boost = glide pose 2026-11-10 (src/build_glideboost.py + BGL in build_aerialboost.py): the aerial boost forces the pitch parameter p of the blend setup (BGL, hook 001C8728, dragon animation object 0041C140) to 0.0 so the game plays the wings-out dive / glide clip. On a ground stage BGL now jumps (GNDX) to GBL (005BCF00), which continues the same boost code (BCM) when Caim rides (003ACC94 == 2), the toggle word 005BEE0C is 0 (fast mode) and the L2 pressure byte (00342864 + index byte 005747BA) is >= 0x40; otherwise nothing changes. The standard mode boost keeps the normal animation. BGL grew by 2 words so GMOV moved by 8 bytes and every cave that jumps into its labels was regenerated (DRT -> CONT, DOD -> NOE, STRAFE -> OUT).
