// 2026-11-14 no L1 ascent in fast mode: AS (005B7368, the ascent speed cave entered from 005BD028) in fast mode jumps to NL1 (005BD05C) as if L1 were not held (no ascent), in free mode loads -2.0; FL1 (005B73D8, entered from 005BD200, the lui / lbu of 005BD200 / 204 are redone inside it and 005BD204 is a nop in the delay slot) makes L1C see L1 as not held in fast mode, so its dodge bits are not cleared and L1 keeps its vanilla function there. Free mode unchanged.
