// Cross brake 2026-11-10 (src/build_aerialboost.py, caves XCB1 005B8700 / XCB2 005B8720, called from GMOV): holding Cross (pressure byte 0034286E >= 0x40) brakes the ridden ground Angelus in the fast mode (R3 toggle off) exactly like the R3 brake did: the momentum slide, dodges suspend it, L3 glide / L2 as before. In the brake (hover) mode the brake is on anyway. Untested in-game.
patch=1,EE,005B8700,word,8D6AEE0C
patch=1,EE,005B8704,word,2D4A0001
patch=1,EE,005B8708,word,3C09005B
