// 2026-11-14: the descent speed bonus (BON, 005BD4D0) is off in fast mode: the delay slot of the j BON at 005BD0F4 (005BD0F8) is now movz t8,zero,t2 (t2 = free mode word, loaded at 005BD0AC): in fast mode t8 = 0, so BON takes its fade path and the bonus stays 0; free mode unchanged. // 2026-11-14: the height dependence of the fast mode boost speed is removed: BST (005BD400) now multiplies the height fraction by 0.0 (005BD48C lui at,0) and adds a fixed 2.0 (005BD498 lui at,0x4000), so the fast mode boost is a constant 2.0x (it was 2.5 for a moment on 2026-11-14). // Fast mode boost speed 2.0x (lowest height) .. 3.0x (highest), build_boostspeed.py: BST 005BD400, VH 005BD300 (hook 0017FD6C stores the terrain height in word 005BEDF0)
