// 2026-11-14 FAST MODE + Cross held (ground ride): the reticle and the fireball aim 45 deg lower (with the height lock). Reticle: 005B70F0 j 5B8900 sets the neutral cos/sin (13 deg, f5/f6: the neutral now lives in this cave, the old words at 005B70F8.. are dead) and rotates them by D when [005BEE0C] == 0 and Cross (00342 86E >= 0x40) is held, then j 005B7108. Fireball: 005BD9D4 j 5B89A4 sets the neutral pitch f2 (word BC8EFA35) and subtracts D (lower aim = lower pitch value), then j 0017EAC4. Neutral constants must be edited inside the caves.
