// ===== Ground: Triangle turn-around while riding Angelus (same as both dodges; needs the Aerial controls section) =====
// Ground stages: while Angelus is ridden (Angelus actor 003ACF20 +0x20 = 5 and +0x3A4 = 2) Triangle does the turn-around, like the aerial Triangle U-turn: both dodge actions (0x1000000 | 0x2000000) are held in the held-action word s0 and the dodge-difference bits 0x300000 cleared, i.e. both dodges pressed at once whatever buttons they are mapped to. SHIFT2 (003409B4, pad update) only handled aerial stages (aerial marker 00340DFC); its skip branch at 003409BC now goes to 003409F4 -> RT (005B7740), which does the riding check and the Triangle test (digital word 00342898 bit 0x1000) and returns to the normal exit 003409E8. The aerial-only longer dodge (DODGE) is not used here.
patch=1,EE,005B7740,word,3C19003B
patch=1,EE,005B7744,word,8F38CF40
