// Fast mode toggle 2026-11-10: the mode of the old "brake" toggle (word 005BEE0C, 1 = the hover / strafe mode with swapped sticks, white reticle, L3 dodge) is now the STANDARD mode: the word starts at 1 (a one-time patch=0 line below: every patch=1 line is rewritten each frame, which made R3 unable to toggle) and GMOV sets it to 1 (instead of 0) whenever the dragon moves with nobody riding, so every mount and every level start is in that mode. R3 toggles the old normal mode, now called fast mode (word = 0): its controls are unchanged (steering stick = left stick, L3 glide, L2 boost 2.5x). GMOV GNO sets the toggle to 1 on a dismount.
patch=0,EE,005BEE0C,word,00000001
// Strafe speed during a dodge 2026-11-10: in brake mode the strafe adds the stick movement at |n| (the game movement this frame). During a dodge |n| includes the dodge own speed (about 20 more than the cruise), so a dodge with the stick held went about twice as fast. GMOV now keeps f13 at the cruise value of the last frame without a dodge (word 005BEE1C), so the strafe during a dodge is a cruise-speed strafe on top of the vanilla dodge.
patch=1,EE,005BC8F4,word,00000000
patch=1,EE,005BC8F8,word,00000000
