// ===== Fog: terrain fog constants 8000-12288 (packet copy hook; aerial stages only) =====
// 2026-10-30: TFOG now forces the terrain fog only in aerial stages (aerial marker 00340DFC != 0): its word 005B6A90 (lui t0,BD73) jumps to TFOGX (005BDC00), which skips to 005B6AC0 (the game's own constants) when the marker is 0, otherwise does the replaced lui and continues at 005B6A94. Ground stages keep the game's own terrain fog.
// A read breakpoint on 0040A0F4 stopped at 0022A124 (lqc2 vf16,0x280(a0), a0 = 00409E70 = the heightmap grid header): the function at 0022A0B0 copies 17 quadwords from a0+0x180..a0+0x2A0 into the terrain VU1 packet every frame, and a0+0x280 = 0040A0F0 holds the fog constants A, B, A2, B2 (the game rewrites them every frame before this copy, so memory patches never stuck). The word at 0022A124 becomes j TFOG (005B6A80); the lqc2 in its delay slot (vf17) still runs. TFOG, only when a0 = 00409E70, writes A = -0.05947, B = 730.75, A2 = -0.02985 and B2 = 366.81 to a0+0x280 / 0x284 / 0x288 / 0x28C (the values the hooked fog setups produce for fog 8000 to 12288), then does the replaced lqc2 vf16,0x280(a0) and returns to 0022A12C.
patch=1,EE,005B6A80,word,3C090041
