[Display, HUD and menus]
author=Shade
description=Widescreen, widescreen HUD, sky gradient, special flash and faster menus.
// 8 original sections merged here (the comment lines headed by ===== name ===== are the original sections).
// ===== Widescreen 16:9 =====
// From the PCSX2 patches repo (InfiniteNine, ported from PAL code by ElHecht); original bytes verified against the game.
gsaspectratio=16:9
patch=1,EE,002FD034,word,3C013F40
patch=1,EE,002FD040,word,4481F000
