// ===== Menus: chapter map 4x (story / expedition, chapter and verse select) =====
// Speed set to 2x on 2026-10-25 at the user's request (005B76A0 = 240C0001, one extra update per frame).
// The chapter map (Story / Expedition bar, chapter and verse lists, verse description, the band that opens after loading) is one big per-frame state machine, FUN_002D4384 (map object 004FF440), called once per frame by CGWorldMapModeTask::Execute at 001505D4 until it returns 0. Its animations are dozens of fixed per-frame steps, so instead of patching each one the call becomes jal MAP4 (005B7680): MAP4 runs the normal update, then (if it did not return 0) up to 3 extra updates in the same frame, stopping as soon as one returns 0, so every animation runs at 4x. During the extra updates the flag 005B7700 is 1 and the two button-press readers FUN_001287F0 and FUN_00128850 (first words now j SUPP1 005B7620 / j SUPP2 005B7650) return 0, so a press is only seen by the first update and still counts once (no double cursor moves or double confirms). With the flag 0 they run exactly as before (SUPP redoes the replaced addiu sp,sp,-0x10 and continues at +8). The word 240C0003 (addiu t4,zero,3) at 005B76A0 sets the extra count (1 = 2x, 2 = 3x).
patch=1,EE,005B7620,word,3C19005B
