// ===== Enemies: arrows and thrown shots fly 2x faster (vanilla while riding Angelus) =====
// The arrow / lobbed projectile item (CGArmParabolaItem exec 001939D0) advances its flight progress (+0x18C, divided by the flight time +0x1B4) by the frame step each frame; the add at 00193F20 is done twice (cave 005BAE80), so every parabola shot arrives in half the time (once = vanilla while Caim rides Angelus). NOT while Caim rides Angelus: the extra add is skipped then (vanilla speed; ground riding test Angelus +0x20 == 5 and +0x3A4 == 2, aerial stage marker 00340DFC != 0; cave rebuilt by build_ridevanilla.py).
