// ===== Enemies: aggro and chase range 2x, twice as many groups can engage at once =====
// FUN_00168xxx squad behaviour (state machine at 0016833C..). The aggro and chase distances are the squad record's radii * 10 * f20; f20 (1.0, or 3.0 for squads early in the wave) is doubled (001682E4 / 001682F8). Squad level 3 (full attack) was given only to squads with wave slot +0x9CA < 29 and index +0x9C8 < 10 (001680.. in FUN_00167FFC): both limits are doubled (00168040 / 0016804C), so about two groups engage at once instead of one while the others wait behind. Not tested in-game.
