// ===== Enemies: spell magic balls fly 2x faster =====
// The magic ball item (CGArmMagicBallItem; position at item +0x80, found through the position copy at +0x2D0 and a write breakpoint at 003E5CF0 -> swc1 at 0018FF18) is moved by FUN_0018FE18, listed in the item's state function table at 00521CB0: each frame it multiplies its velocity vector ([s0+0x1B0], three floats) by the frame step dt (lwc1 f0,44(a1), 003A932C) and adds the result to the position. The word at 0018FE70 (lwc1 f5,0(sp)) becomes j 005BDE80; the original lwc1 f0,44(a1) in its delay slot still runs, and the cave redoes the lwc1 and doubles f0 (x 2.0) before returning to 0018FE78, so the ball covers twice the distance per frame. Not tested in-game; the factor is the 0x4000 in the lui at 005BDE84 (0x4040 = 3x). NOT while Caim rides Angelus: the doubling is skipped then (build_ridevanilla.py).
